    "post_rendered": "Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\"  width=\"42\" height=\"13\" > an isosceles triangle and <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/b/01bcec898740fce9c2d19eea4090b388a8ad08b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC&gt;AB=AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"133\" height=\"13\" >.</span> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02d958282167e071fd04acca9240edd882eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D,M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" > are respectively midpoints of <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/a/e7a96a483787d7444cf170acb08bbebef791058d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC, AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" >.</span> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"12\" > is a point such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8baadf35cbdce63c6a596c58e7ae28fac20e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX\\perp AC$\"  width=\"83\" height=\"13\" > and <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06ba8966bce4001884ed8dd03361f12ec3d49a30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XD||AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" >.</span> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7a4b9c32938e96f30b59dcb29f410cd4c2e3982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BX$\"  width=\"30\" height=\"12\" > and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\"  width=\"28\" height=\"13\" > meet at <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\"  width=\"16\" height=\"12\" >.</span> If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\"  width=\"14\" height=\"12\" > is intersection point of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/4/72451f73f38f596f3450e2699e9143eaf0391930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DX$\"  width=\"31\" height=\"12\" > and circumcircle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd59d44a59591174868c2aa1b9a4d796f519c16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AHX$\"  width=\"45\" height=\"13\" > (other than <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"12\" >)</span>, prove that tangent from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\"  width=\"13\" height=\"13\" > to circumcircle of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b562ad3c803c3cbe6f2b6e1bd160acd5fe5d91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AMP$\"  width=\"47\" height=\"13\" > is parallel to <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\"  width=\"28\" height=\"12\" >.</span>",
