    "post_rendered": "Sequence of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d4385b1e3413516fe418fe56d161d6c0dd6fd50a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0,a_1,\\dots,a_{1389}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"117\" height=\"11\" > are called concave if for each <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/2/622daf2fd47f781f0b576a7f918cbfbdf0f5f6d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;i&lt;1389$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"99\" height=\"13\" >,</span> <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e87d917212d3ad5846a1173723724f7093761498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i\\geq\\frac{a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"128\" height=\"35\" >.</span> Find the largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\"  width=\"8\" height=\"8\" > such that for every concave sequence of non-negative real numbers:<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a6bc7c23122b56b28ccfbe8354ebf75f60074e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=0}^{1389}ia_i^2\\geq c\\sum_{i=0}^{1389}a_i^2\\]\"  width=\"132\" height=\"50\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Sequence of real numbers $a_0,a_1,\\dots,a_{1389}$ are called concave if for each $0<i<1389$, $a_i\\geq\\frac{a_{i-1}+a_{i+1}}2$. Find the largest $c$ such that for every concave sequence of non-negative real numbers:\n\\[\\sum_{i=0}^{1389}ia_i^2\\geq c\\sum_{i=0}^{1389}a_i^2\\]",
