    "post_rendered": "Prove that for each natural number <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"8\" >,</span> there is a natural number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\"  width=\"16\" height=\"12\" > such that for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\"  width=\"8\" height=\"12\" > that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a3ec69a4e0d477549736debea5fa7c375a35d67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\leq b\\leq1389$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" > sum of digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\"  width=\"16\" height=\"12\" > in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\"  width=\"8\" height=\"12\" > is larger than <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\"  width=\"15\" height=\"8\" >.</span>",
